ed sample without eating it.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Recorded source and sample visible-state findings and their limitations.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A physical method capable of assessing dietary properties with explicit limitations and costs.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a bounded assessment procedure distinct from visible-state observation, and evaluate the response before use.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Two recorded berry meals each supplied 8 realized nutrition. No hazelnut dietary benefit has been demonstrated.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

